# Keith Everywhere — Technical Design

## 1. Outcome

Keith Everywhere is one expansion of the existing Keith product, not five adjacent products. The same daemon, profile, credentials, durable sessions, action inbox, approvals, audit records, event stream, resource governor, and client connection remain authoritative while five new capabilities are added:

1. Meta-Harness repairs harness-caused failures through bounded candidate search and held-out evidence.
2. Channel reach expands beyond Discord to Slack, Telegram, WhatsApp Cloud, Microsoft Teams, Google Chat, email, and Matrix.
3. ACP makes Keith available to compatible clients and editors without adding another agent loop.
4. Typed WASI plugins and Composio sessions connect external applications under Keith authority.
5. Keith Computer provides an isolated visible workstation with exclusive co-control and teach-by-demonstration.

The release succeeds only when these capabilities work together in one durable user journey.

